                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Top"} Top
          %p
            More details can be found in
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#support"} Fritz-Perrone-Rezagholi ‘19
          %p
            See also
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/correspondence+between+measure+and+valuation+theory"} correspondence between measure and valuation theory
          %h3#the_probability_monad_on_top The probability monad on Top
          %p
            If one restricts the measure monad above to the
            = succeed "-smooth" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi τ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tau
            %em probability
            measures (i.e. normalized), one obtains again a submonad, which seems to be the most general
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/probability+monad"} probability monad
            on
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Top"} Top
          %p
            If a topological space is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tychonoff+space"} Tychonoff
            (for example a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/metric+space"} metric space
            or a
            = succeed ")," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Hausdorff+space"} compact Hausdorff space
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+topology"} weak topology
            of measures with respect to continuous functions. In particular, on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subcategory"} subcategory
            of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Hausdorff+spaces"} compact Hausdorff spaces
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Radon+monad"} Radon monad
          %h3#the_monad_of_topological_cones The monad of topological cones
          %p
            If one restrict to
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/valuation+%28measure+theory%29#simple_valuations"} simple valuations
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
