                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [0,\infty]
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/module+object"} module object
            monad).
          %h3#the_monad_of_topological_convex_spaces The monad of topological convex spaces
          %p
            If one further restricts to
            %em normalized
            simple valuations, one obtains as submonad the free
            %span.newWikiWord
